प्रति-√ पश् only pr. P. -पश्यति, to look at, perceive, see, behold, RV.; AV.; Br.; MBh.;
to live to see, experience, MBh.;
 (Ā. ˚ते) to see in one's own possession, AV.

प्रति-√ पाल् P. -पालयति (ep. also ˚ते), to protect, defend, guard, keep, MBh.; R.;
to observe, maintain, ib.;
to wait, wait for, expect, ChUp.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.

प्रति-√ पॄ P. -पृणाति (only 2. du. Impv. -पृणीत॑म्), to bestow in return, RV. vii, 65, 5 :
Caus. -पूरयति, to fill up, make full, ĀśvGṛ.; Suśr.;
to fill (said of a noise), MBh.;
to sate, satiate, satisfy, ib.;
to fulfil, accomplish, R.
